WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:03.540
2018 is shaping up to be a great year at the
movies.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.980
Big franchises are set to continue with exciting
new installments, while highly anticipated

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:11.940
original films promise to take audiences to
worlds they've never even imagined.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.560
These would-be blockbusters have the potential
to launch a new generation of stars and showcase

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.380
incredible performances from established actors.

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.660
These are just some of the acting performances
you should look out for in 2018.

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.040
Chadwick Boseman—Black Panther

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:30.600
If you were blown away by Chadwick Boseman's
debut as Black Panther in Captain America:

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.900
Civil War, get ready to see him step up his
game even further in his 2018 solo debut.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:40.660
Black Panther will follow Boseman's T'Challa
as he returns to Wakanda to take his rightful

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.580
place as king.

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.940
It won't be all smooth sailing for T'Challa,
though.

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:48.540
He'll have to face off against a number of
foes, particularly Michael B. Jordan's Erik

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:51.540
Killmonger , a dissident who wants the throne
for himself.

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:56.040
Although we haven't seen them go head to head
yet, all signs point to an epic cat fight.

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.320
"Meow."

00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.280
Helen Mirren—Winchester

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:03.320
A horror movie starring Oscar winner Helen
Mirren?

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:05.800
Sign us up for Winchester: The House That
Ghosts Built.

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:11.050
The film features Mirren as Sarah Winchester,
a real-life heiress who put her entire fortune

00:01:11.050 --> 00:01:14.340
into her mansion, now known as the Winchester
Mystery House.

00:01:14.509 --> 00:01:18.540
Although Mirren has made horror movies in
the past, Winchester's real-life roots—and

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:23.080
her character's complex, fragile mental state—should
add extra weight to her work.

00:01:23.260 --> 00:01:27.939
Seeing an actress of Mirren's caliber taking
on such a multifaceted role sounds like a

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:29.400
recipe for pure terror.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:31.480
The cast of Annihilation

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.659
Natalie Portman leads an excellent cast in
the sci-fi thriller Annihilation, which follows

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:39.940
a group of scientists who head into a mysterious
disaster zone.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:44.500
The trailers have teased some terrifying creatures
and tense scenarios, and the film's eerie

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.359
science fiction elements should elevate it
beyond traditional horror fare.

00:01:48.359 --> 00:01:53.149
Joining Portman on her quest are Oscar Isaac,
Jennifer Jason Leigh, and Gina Rodriguez,

00:01:53.149 --> 00:01:58.140
who boast an Oscar win, three Oscar nominations,
and five Golden Globe wins between them.

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.820
That's a heavyweight cast, but will all that
acting cred be enough to get them past Annihilation's

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:03.680
monsters alive?

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.780
Jennifer Lawrence—Red Sparrow

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:10.259
Jennifer Lawrence already has an Oscar and
three more nominations to her name, so every

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:13.820
role she takes spurs anticipation for an impressive
performance.

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:18.040
And with her action thriller Red Sparrow,
Lawrence has taken what could be her most

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.240
exciting role to date, a ballerina turned
Russian spy.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:25.780
As teased in the movie's intense trailer,
she's part of an elite group of assassins

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:29.400
called the Sparrow Squad, who will use whatever
it takes to get the job done.

00:02:29.560 --> 00:02:34.420
Although we've mostly seen small, wordless
pieces of Lawrence's performance thus far,

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.740
she looks killer in the role.

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:38.260
Storm Reid—A Wrinkle In Time

00:02:38.660 --> 00:02:43.480
Madeleine L'Engle's philosophical sci-fi odyssey
A Wrinkle in Time isn't an easy book to bring

00:02:43.489 --> 00:02:47.720
to the big screen, and the fact that it's
been so beloved by generations of readers

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.900
means there's all the more pressure to get
it right.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:54.820
One of the biggest pieces of the puzzle was
the film's lead, Meg Murry; luckily, director

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:58.629
Ava DuVernay found just the right person for
the part in Storm Reid.

00:02:58.629 --> 00:03:02.440
DuVernay has been very vocal about how impressed
she was with Reid's performance.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.980
Although we don't know much about how DuVernay
will depict Meg's journey on the big screen,

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.540
Reid seems poised to cement her rising star
status with an out of this world performance.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:12.700
"You're kidding."

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:14.480
"Do I look like I'm kidding?"

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:15.260
"A little.."

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:15.860
"I'm not."

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.840
The cast of New Mutants

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:22.840
2018's New Mutants adds something very different
to the superhero genre: horror.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:29.120
Director Josh Boone spearheads the film, which
features a group of young mutants who find

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:33.620
themselves held in a secret facility against
their will, forcing them to battle the dangers

00:03:33.620 --> 00:03:36.560
of their powers and the sins of their pasts
to try and escape.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:41.900
The movie has amassed an impressive cast of
young talent, led by three genre favorites—Split's

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:47.260
Anya Taylor-Joy, Game of Thrones' Maisie Williams,
and Stranger Things' Charlie Heaton.

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:51.439
That's some of the best young talent around,
and it should all add up to a very unique

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.560
superhero movie

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.460
Tom Hardy—Venom

00:03:54.740 --> 00:03:58.840
Many people may have been a bit apprehensive
about Sony's planned universe of Spider-Man

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.650
movies that don't feature Spider-Man, but
their fears should have been quieted a bit

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:06.540
when Tom Hardy was announced as the lead for
the first Spidey spinoff, Venom.

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.980
The Oscar nominee is set to play main character
Eddie Brock, with the movie rumored to offer

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:15.000
an R-rated, sci-fi horror take on the morally
ambiguous Marvel villain.

00:04:17.180 --> 00:04:18.300
"Together again!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:20.880
We knew it wasn't a delusion."

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:26.220
Hardy isn't the only talented actor attached
to star in Venom—Jenny Slate, Michelle Williams,

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:30.820
and Woody Harrelson are all on board as well,
along with Zombieland director Ruben Fleischer.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:35.100
Still, the performance of the leading man
will make or break the film, and Hardy seems

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:36.200
like the man for the job.

00:04:36.340 --> 00:04:37.360
Thanks for watching!

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.180
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:04:40.260 --> 00:04:42.700
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

